layout_mode = 0
offset_right = 1099.0
theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 12
text = "There's someone in the tent, huddled in the corner, clad in a thin hoodie and sweat pants. Facing away from you. They aren't moving at all.

You feel grateful their belongings are left near to the entrance: A handful of batteries, some packaged noodles, and a few bottles of water.

A glitter of brass sitting on a sleeping bag catches your eye. You pocket the pistol rounds, but there isn't a weapon anywhere to be seen.

You feel you've overstayed your welcome.

+1 SUPPLIES
+1 AMMUNITION"
